{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, Clause A.1 (g)(i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended) as amended because: \r\nThe existing plans are drawn incorrectly and do not include the existing conservatory which does not form part of the original house. With the existing conservatory included in the assessment for the single storey rear extension, the extension will be 7.68m deep and therefore exceeding the 6 metres for a semi-detached house.\r\n"
